<record id="project_command_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">kd.project.command</field><field name="model">tp.project.command</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form><group><field name="project_id" string="Dự án"/><field name="package_id" invisible="not package_id"/><field name="kind" string="Loại cập nhật"/><field name="participation_id" readonly="1" invisible="kind != 'party_revoke'"/><field name="expected_version"/><field name="target_state" invisible="kind != 'status'" required="kind == 'status'"/><field name="bid_stage" invisible="kind != 'bid'"/><field name="bid_outcome" invisible="kind != 'bid'"/><field name="project_name" invisible="kind != 'metadata'" required="kind == 'metadata'"/><field name="investor_id" invisible="kind != 'metadata'"/><field name="scope" invisible="kind != 'metadata'"/><field name="correction_id" domain="[('project_id','=',project_id)]" invisible="kind != 'note'"/><field name="reason" required="1"/></group><p>Ghi căn cứ được phép chia sẻ trong phạm vi quyền của hồ sơ. Không gửi email hoặc tự mở hiệu lực/duyệt/ký.</p><footer><button name="action_confirm" type="object" string="Lưu cập nhật" class="btn-primary"/><button special="cancel" string="Hủy"/></footer></form></field></record>
<record id="task_command_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">kd.task.command</field><field name="model">tp.task.command</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form><group><field name="project_id" string="Dự án"/><field name="task_id" invisible="not task_id"/><field name="operation"/><field name="name" invisible="operation not in ('create','edit')" required="operation in ('create','edit')"/><field name="parent_id" domain="[('project_id','=',project_id)]" invisible="operation not in ('create','edit')"/><field name="responsible_id" invisible="operation not in ('create','assign')" required="operation in ('create','assign')"/><field name="deadline" invisible="operation not in ('create','edit')"/><field name="deliverable" invisible="operation not in ('create','edit')" required="operation in ('create','edit')"/><field name="description" invisible="operation not in ('create','edit')"/><field name="target_state" invisible="operation != 'progress'" required="operation == 'progress'"/><field name="reason" required="1"/></group><p>Hoàn tất công việc không là nghiệm thu. Không ghi số tiền vào mô tả hoặc lý do task; dữ liệu thương mại mở theo quyền riêng.</p><footer><button name="action_confirm" type="object" string="Lưu công việc" class="btn-primary"/><button special="cancel" string="Hủy"/></footer></form></field></record>
